@host = http://localhost:5082
@playlistId = 1
@songId = 4
@userId = 0

### Create a collaborative playlist. The response contains its ID.
POST {{host}}/api/playlists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Friday Playlist",
  "createdBy": 0,
  "isCollaborative": true
}

### List all playlists.
GET {{host}}/api/playlists

### List playlists created by or shared with a user.
GET {{host}}/api/playlists?userId={{userId}}

### List the song catalog. The catalogue starts empty; create a song below first.
GET {{host}}/api/songs

### Search the catalog by title, artist, or genre.
GET {{host}}/api/songs?search=pop

### Create a song in the empty catalogue. Its returned ID is 4 on a fresh server. Update songId above if needed.
POST {{host}}/api/songs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Weekend Sky",
  "artist": "Sample Artist",
  "genre": "Pop",
  "durationSeconds": 180
}

### Add a catalog song to a playlist.
PUT {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/add?userId={{userId}}&songId={{songId}}

### The creator (user 0) invites user 1.
PUT {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/invite?userId={{userId}}&collaboratorUserId=1

### The creator votes for a song.
POST {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/vote?userId={{userId}}&songId={{songId}}

### The invited user can also vote. Each user gets one vote per song per playlist.
POST {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/vote?userId=1&songId={{songId}}

### Get song details and votes, ordered from highest votes to lowest.
GET {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/rankings?userId={{userId}}

### Only the creator can remove a song from the playlist.
DELETE {{host}}/api/playlists/{{playlistId}}/songs/{{songId}}?userId={{userId}}
